flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Enter learner and guardian fields/]
    B --> C[Validate required fields, positive age, 11-digit contact]
    C --> D{Valid?}
    D -- No --> E[/Show alert/]
    E --> B
    D -- Yes --> F[/Show enrollment modal: fee 6,500 and discount 0/]
    F --> G{Save selected?}
    G -- No --> H([Cancel])
    G -- Yes --> I[(Save student)]
    I --> J[(Add automatic 20% voucher)]
    J --> K[(Add discounted 5,200 enrollment payment)]
    K --> L[/Show success/]
    L --> M([End])
    I -. write failure .-> N[/Partial state possible/]
    J -. write failure .-> N
    N --> M
